---

<section class='py-24 sm:py-32 px-6 bg-gradient-to-b from-dark-950 via-dark-900 to-dark-950'>
  <div class='mx-auto max-w-7xl'>
    <div class='text-center mb-16 gsap-fadein'>
      <h2 class='text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6'>
        Transparente <span class='text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-primary-800'>Preise</span>
      </h2>
      <p class='text-xl text-light-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto'>
        Faire IT- und Design-Services zu einem attraktiven Stundensatz
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class='mx-auto mt-16 max-w-5xl rounded-2xl gsap-fadein bg-gradient-to-br from-dark-900 to-dark-950 border border-blue-500/30 text-light-100 shadow-xl hover:border-blue-500/50 hover:shadow-2xl transition-all duration-300 lg:flex'>
      <div class='p-8 sm:p-10 lg:flex-auto'>
        <h3 class='text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4'>Faire Preise für hochwertige IT-Leistungen</h3>
        <p class='text-base text-light-300 mb-8'>Ich biete Ihnen umfassende IT- und Design-Services zu einem attraktiven Stundensatz. Qualität und Kundenzufriedenheit stehen dabei immer an erster Stelle.</p>
        
        <div class='flex items-center gap-x-4 mb-6'>
          <h4 class='text-sm font-semibold text-white'>Leistungsübersicht:</h4>
          <div class='h-px flex-auto bg-blue-500/30'></div>
        </div>
        
        <ul role='list' class='grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2 text-light-300'>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Webdesign & Printmedien</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>IT-Administration & Support</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Open-Source-Software-Lösungen</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Webentwicklung (Websites, Anwendungen)</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>DevSecOps & Prozessoptimierung</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>IT-Beratung</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
            </svg>
            <span>Individuelle Smart Home Konzepte</span>
          </li>
          <li class='flex gap-x-3'>
            <svg class='h-6 w-5 flex-none text-blue-400' viewBox='0 0 20 20' fill='currentColor' aria-hidden='true'>
              <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M16.403 12.652a3 3 0 0 0 0-5.304 3 3 0 0 0-3.75-3.751 3 3 0 0 0-5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0-3.751 3.75 3 3 0 0 0 0 5.305 3 3 0 0 0 3.75 3.751 3 3 0 0 0 5.305 0 3 3 0 0 0 3.751-3.75Zm-2.546-4.46a.75.75 0 0 0-1.214-.883l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 1 0-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 0 0 1.137-.089l4-5.5Z" clip-rule="evenodd" />
